<h1 class="contract">settrademkt</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Create or Update Trade Market
summary: Create or update a trade market with specified parameters and updaters.
---

<h1 class="contract">pause</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Set Trade Market Pause Status
summary: Set the pause status of a trade market by an updater account.
---

<h1 class="contract">setprice</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Set Trade Market Price
summary: Set the target price of a trade market by an updater account.
---

<h1 class="contract">setupdaters</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Set Trade Market Updaters
summary: Set the updater accounts for a trade market.
---

<h1 class="contract">deltrademkt</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Delete Trade Market
summary: Delete a trade market by name.
---


